  "rationale": "Block vpnSession:authenticate, sshKey:credentialAccess, and mailArchive:collection. Blocking sshKey also disables apiToken; together these blocks disable printServer and domainAdmin, preventing codeRepo collection. Blocking vpnSession disables serviceAccount and hypervisor, preventing dbReplica and vaultRead collection. All four routes into the target are therefore stopped. Three blocks are necessary because there are three attack derivations with disjoint blockable steps: (sshKey, printServer, codeRepo); (tokenCache, monitoringHost, mailArchive); and (browserStore, mailClient, vpnSession, kerberoast, backupHost, serviceAccount, dbReplica). Each derivation is supported by entry footholds and must have at least one of its steps blocked."
